### Create a team (201 Created)
# @name createTeam
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Backend"
}

### Fetch the created team (200 OK)
GET {{createTeam.response.headers.Location}}

### Unknown team (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams/0

### Reject a blank name (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": ""
}
